==Restrictions==
*This stage uses [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 deploy costs.

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*4 [[Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use what you learned about traits in the previous stage. Deploy [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]] to deal with the red enemies while using [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] supported by [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] will lead to your inevitable victory.

==Hints==
This hint only appears as a defeat message upon losing the stage.
*Level up Worker Cat Rate from the<br>Upgrade menu to increase the speed<br>at which you earn Money.<br>Money (mostly) solves all problems!

